WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You and I had
the most wonderful trip,

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.436 line:92%
because we met in Amsterdam.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.772 size:84% position:42%
We worked for a theater
called Boom Chicago.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:08.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Boom Chicago had its
25th anniversary this summer.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.377
-It did.
-Which was great because I think

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:13.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
only a 25th anniversary
would our spouses allow us

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
to go back to Amsterdam.
-Yeah.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.249 line:92%
-And there's a bunch of us here.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
Colton Dunn,
there's my brother Josh,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jill Benjamin, Josie O'Reilly,
Liz Cackowski.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Liz Cackowski, good group.
-And how did you --

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:25.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were there for three days
back in Amsterdam,

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:25.792 line:92%
where we lived in our 20s.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and it's very different
living in Amsterdam

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.498
when your in your mid-20s
than when you're early 40s.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.098 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.834
-It's bad when you're early 40s,
because your body --

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
if you know this, Seth.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your body changes
as you get older.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.272
-Yeah.
-I don't know if you knew that.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.241
-Yeah.
-I found it out, and, you know,

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you're in your 20s,
you can drink, oh, 20 beers.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:45.545 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.415 size:75% position:38%
-I did that with you
a couple months ago.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.449 line:92%
-Yeah, 'cause you definitely --

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
You still have the head
of a 20-year-old, my friend.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I do.
Yeah, I do.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
Spiritually, I'm 20.
-Yeah.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.289 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Physically, I'm --

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your spirit animal
is you at 20.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-It is.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:03.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my physical animal is...
Remember Buddy Ebsen?

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.533
From "The Beverly Hillbillies"?
-Yeah.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's --
that's who it is.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:10.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well I remember
you and Liz Cackowski,

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's a fantastic
comedian, writer,

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:15.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
you guys flew out together,
and the pictures on the flight

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Amsterdam, where you guys,
like, yeah, toast.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:18.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You're so happy.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then tell us
about the flight home.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The flight home,
I don't remember it,

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.953
but I remember turning to her
dramatically in the lounge

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:31.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
and going, "Liz,
I need to get on that plane."

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sounded like Harrison Ford in
"Air Force One,"

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
but the opposite.
-Yeah.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And she was like,
"All right, fine.

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.832 size:88% position:44%
Don't worry about it."
-Now, it should be noted

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
that this is an early flight
leaving Amsterdam.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
And how much had you slept?
-0.0 hours.

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.605 size:75% position:38%
-Okay, gotcha. Yeah.
-I laid in a park.

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.507
-Yeah, you fell asleep in a park
for a second.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:50.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but I put my hat out.
I got a couple bucks.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:50.977 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bought a nice broodje
at the airport.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.915 size:75% position:38%
-Dutch for sandwich.
-Dutch for sandwich.

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:00.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you.
Yeah, it was --

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.889
But then, I woke up seven hours
in, I felt great.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:06.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then for two weeks,
I had depression.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And then I felt great.

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, well, that's good.
-Yes.

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.396 line:92%
-Well, it was a great trip,

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was worth
two weeks of depression.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
No doubt.

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your wife and my wife
both very nice.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have two kids.
You've got three now.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.471 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Three kids. Yeah.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, now I know
Halloween's coming up.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you guys
enthusiastic about it?

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They are.
The kids are.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.411 line:92%
We're doing a "Star Wars" theme.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's great.
-Yeah it's great.

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:29.616
Rey, then my wife is Leia,
then the middle kid is Yoda,

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then
the youngest is Chewbacca.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
Han Solo, obviously.
-Uh-huh.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:34.487 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But maybe Han
from "The Force Awakens."

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
The kind of slower...
"Huh, huh. Huh."

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
He always looked surprised --
"Hunh! Hunh!"

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.264 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:45.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah.
-I'm glad you've gotten

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:48.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
