00:02:58.912 --> 00:02:59.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Congratulations.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:02.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep.
I found a guy on Craigslist.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:06.986
He just -- He came over and just
kicked me in the nuts a bunch.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:08.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And, uh --

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:11.224
