-I did have the vasectomy.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:13.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, gotcha.
-Yeah, which --

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Was everybody in the family
in agreement?

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
