-This is after the fact?
-This is after the fact.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then the fact...
-Okay.

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:33.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...was that -- I don't know
